                  <photoshop:LayerName>     At present, the vlinker MC version supports all functions </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>     At present, the vlinker MC version supports all functions of  forscan, such as reading fault code, clearing fault code, reading  data stream, reset module, brush hiding,ECU programming.  Because the vlinker MC is a wireless configuration, ECU  programmingwill be slow in the process of upgrading. After  waiting for the vlinker FD USB version to face the market, this problem of slow upgrading can be solved.</photoshop:LayerText>
