                  <photoshop:LayerText>Circuit High Input ( When the PCM sees a voltage that is higher  than the normal upper limit, P0123 will set) .User can internet  the OBD Code meaning and know the possible causes).  More descrip on please visit here : h ps://www.obd-codes.com /p0123</photoshop:LayerText>
